# Toy macro for `make cosim-smoke` (cosim.py smoke), same format as analogioc.ports:
# <bit> <direction seen from the macro> <kind> <domain>. A 4-phase integ handshake and
# two sign comparators: the smallest piece of the real contract that crosses both ways.
integ_req in digital vdd
integ_ack out digital vdd
x_neg[0] in digital vdd
x_neg[1] in digital vdd
col_sign[0] out digital vdd
col_sign[1] out digital vdd
vcm inout analog vdd
vdd inout supply vdd
vss inout supply vss
